       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTOMER-BILLING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CUSTOMER-ID        PIC X(10).
       01 CURRENT-BALANCE    PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01 CREDIT-LIMIT       PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01 ACCOUNT-STATUS     PIC X.
          88 ACCOUNT-ACTIVE  VALUE 'A'.
          88 ACCOUNT-HOLD    VALUE 'H'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           IF ACCOUNT-ACTIVE AND CURRENT-BALANCE > CREDIT-LIMIT
              DISPLAY "CUSTOMER OVER LIMIT"
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
